# MAEST 522 annotation metadata

This dataset artifact contains metadata and annotation states only.
{{ audio_rights }} No redistribution right for referenced audio is implied.

## Annotation

{{ annotation_protocol }} Each of the three labels uses `positive`, `negative`,
or `uncertain`. Uncertain cells are masked during training. Hard negatives are
explicit reviewed negatives, not implicit absence labels.

## Leakage prevention

Exact SHA-256, acoustic fingerprints, release identity, and normalized artist
identity define duplicate groups. Groups are assigned once to train/validation/
test and audited before export. Validation and test were blind before student
training. Split audit SHA-256: `{{ split_audit_sha256 }}`.

## Portable JSONL fields

`track_id`, `group_id`, relative `audio_ref`, `split`, `duration_seconds`,
`window_offsets_seconds`, `source_labels`, `candidate_roles`, and per-label
annotation states. Absolute local paths and audio payloads are excluded.

